      `the date it was served` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 63 r 3(3) the application is served as the Rule requires` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Court otherwise orders`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty does not arise; QD: NOTHING, and the companion `o 63 r 3(3) the duty to serve the application personally in time arises` answers JUST FALSE / other: JUST TRUE (nothing is unmet)
        IF `the date it was served` GREATER THAN `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "at least 28 clear days or such longer time as the Court may direct, before the return date"
        IF `the application is served personally on the third party` AND ((NOT (`the Court has directed service on another person appearing to be interested`)) OR `it is served personally on that other person`)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): not yet served personally on the third party (or on the other person the Court directed); a bare "must be served personally"; QB: NOTHING (O 3 r 2(4) and rule 3(6)) / other: JUST FALSE

GIVEN `the Court otherwise orders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application is served personally on the third party` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Court has directed service on another person appearing to be interested` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is served personally on that other person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date it was served` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`o 63 r 3(3) the applicant for directions complied with paragraph (3)` MEANS
    `the Court otherwise orders` OR (`o 63 r 3(3) the application is served as the Rule requires` `the Court otherwise orders` `the application is served personally on the third party` `the Court has directed service on another person appearing to be interested` `it is served personally on that other person` `the date it was served` `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` EQUALS JUST TRUE)

-- (4): advertised in Form 93 at least 21 clear days before the return date.
`o 63 r 3(4) the form of the advertisement` MEANS "93"

-- src:7347 | (4) Every application under paragraph (1) must be advertised in Form 93 at least 21 clear days or such longer time as the Court may direct before the return date, at least once in one English and one Chinese local daily newspaper or in such other newspaper as the Court may direct.
