    IF count (`o 63 r 3(5) the matters the advertisement has not yet stated` advertisement) EQUALS 0
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a bare "must state"; QB: NOTHING (O 3 r 2(4) and rule 3(6)) / other: JUST FALSE

GIVEN advertisement IS A `o 63 r 3(5) advertisement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`o 63 r 3(5) the applicant for directions complied with paragraph (5)` MEANS
    `o 63 r 3(5) the advertisement states what the Rule requires` advertisement EQUALS JUST TRUE

