-- The trace's time unit is a day counted from the filing of the affidavit, as O 3 r 3 counts days.
`o 63 r 4(4) the duty to serve a copy of the affidavit` MEANS
    PARTY `o 63 r 4(4) the claimant`
    MUST `o 63 r 4(4) serve a copy of the affidavit on the third party`
    WITHIN 3
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `o 63 r 4(4) the claimant` BECAUSE "a copy of the affidavit was not served on the third party within 3 days of its filing (O 63 r 4(4))"

