§§ `Rule 5 -- powers of the Court`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 63 r 5(1) hearing` IS ONE OF
    `o 63 r 5(1)(a) the hearing of an application under Rule 2(1)`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(b) the hearing of the third party under Rule 2(7)`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(c) the hearing of an application under Rule 3(1)`
    `o 63 r 5(1) some other stage`

DECLARE `o 63 r 5(1) kind of direction or order` IS ONE OF
    `o 63 r 5(1)(d) for the filing of such further affidavits as the Court considers necessary`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(e) on the manner in which proceedings are to be instituted against the third party`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(f) that an issue be stated and tried`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(g) that the matter be adjourned`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(h) that further advertisements be made in addition to that required under Rule 3(4)`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(i) for the substitution of the claimant making the application under Rule 2(1) or 3(1) with another claimant`
    `o 63 r 5(1)(j) that the application under Rule 2(1) or 3(1) be dismissed`
    `o 63 r 5(1) another kind of direction or order`

